## Critical Path

**Longest dependency chain** (critical for timeline):
```
SETUP-001 → TYPES-001 → CONFIG-001 → GMAIL-001 → GMAIL-002 → GMAIL-003 → AI-001 → AI-002 → AI-003 → RENDER-001 → ORCH-001 → CI-001
