**Parallelization opportunities**:
- INFRA-001 parallel with TYPES-001 (saves 30 min)
- GMAIL-004 parallel with AI-001/AI-002 (saves 1.5 hours)
- TEST-001 parallel with CI-001 (saves 1 hour)

